// One data set -> ONE FHIR Questionnaire via `fold` (collapses the stream into a single
// object; `$rows` is the dataSet stream). Its items come from the nested
// dataSetElements.dataElement. Rule of thumb: transform = per row, fold = whole stream.
dataSets
  | limit 1
  | fold {
      resourceType: "Questionnaire",
      status: "active",
      title: $rows.name.first(),
      item: $rows.dataSetElements.dataElement.select({ linkId: id, text: name, type: "string" })
    }
